cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to Praxis, please cite it as below."
title: "Praxis: an independent scientific and educational initiative on evidence-based practice and innovation in prosthetics, orthotics and rehabilitation"
abstract: >-
  Praxis is an independent, non-commercial scientific and educational initiative
  dedicated to advancing evidence-based practice (EBP) and innovation in prosthetics,
  orthotics and rehabilitation. It focuses on translational research, the biomechanics
  of gait and upper-limb movement, the objective evaluation of prosthetic technologies
  and the structured synthesis of peer-reviewed literature, with particular attention
  to the Ukrainian clinical context, including combat-related limb loss. Articles are
  published in Ukrainian with English translations.
